  "issue": 445,
  "request": "Goal: standalone plugin agent calls must not use ambient SDD flow authority. Scope: add a generic attribution boundary in src/lib/agent.js and src/lib/plugin-registry.js, with src/lib/log.js only if explicit-null logger context requires it; add fake-provider focused tests covering success, failure, repeated/cache-equivalent paths and managed worktree, single-flow, multiple-flow, and no-flow contexts. Preserve provider/profile/commandId resolution and explicit flow/core attribution. Out of scope: workflow plugin special cases, FlowManager/FlowStore, Issue #443 review transitions, and Issue #444 test runner.",
